      <description>North Wales is braced for snow and ice as the yellow weather warnings for snow and ice continue today (Saturday). The Met Office's current warning is ending at 10am, but will be replaced by a further warning which begins at 3pm tomorrow (Sunday) and lasts until midday on Monday.</description>
